@startuml
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor #555555
}
title Shared Bool guard: admission, trip and recovery (one exclusive group)

[*] --> Idle
Idle : no admitted activity
Idle --> Admitted : fresh true claim\n+ all admission conditions\n+ candidate satisfies safe_output
Idle --> Idle : candidate violates a relation\n(denied: no admission,\nno new protected output)
Admitted : outputs = requested candidate
Admitted --> Admitted : conflicting newcomer claim\n(denied; incumbent and\nprevious safe outputs kept)
Admitted --> Tripped : requested candidate\nviolates a mandatory relation
Tripped : outputs = authored safe vector\n(e.g. pump=false, valve=true)
Tripped --> Tripped : inputs return to normal\n(no automatic restart)
Tripped --> Idle : observation with\nall claims false
@enduml
